ion with Distension (B1) over paralytic ileus/colonic volvulus?", "result_summary": "The presence of post-race abdominal pain, distension, and tenderness with normal temperature slightly weakens the possibility of paralytic ileus and colonic volvulus patterns but does not decisively strengthen mechanical obstruction as a whole. This finding is most neutral for B1 (Intestinal Obstruction with Distension) and its subtypes."}, {"timestep": 4, "bundle_id": 4, "bundle_position": 0, "bundle_size": 1, "action_type": "ANALYZE_VIGNETTE", "external_action": "ANALYZE_VIGNETTE", "content": "Does the presence of documented post-metabolic stress (marathon) without bleeding or rectal symptoms challenge Ischemic Bowel Disease with Hypovolemia as a viable diagnosis?", "result_summary": "The absence of rectal bleeding and the context of post-metabolic stress (marathon) without additional ischemic risk factors reduces the likelihood of Ischemic Bowel Disease with Hypovolemia (B3)."}], "differential_history": [{"B1": 0.5833333333333333, "B2": 0.11574074074074073, "B3": 0.06944444444444443, "B4": 0.1111111111111111, "B5": 0.07407407407407407, "B6": 0.046296296296296294, "B1.1": 0.33333333333333326, "B1.2": 0.16666666666666663, "B1.3": 0.08333333333333331}, {"B1": 0.46035805626598464, "B2": 0.0639386189258312, "B3": 0.03836317135549872, "B4": 0.06138107416879796, "B5": 0.04092071611253197, "B6": 0.012787723785166242, "B1.1": 0.3314578005115089, "B1.2": 0.04603580562659846, "B1.3": 0.08286445012787723}, {"B1": 0.41714947856315177, "B2": 0.028968713789107765, "B3": 0.03476245654692932, "B4": 0.05561993047508692, "B5": 0.037079953650057944, "B6": 0.009269988412514488, "B1.1": 0.30034762456546926, "B1.2": 0.041714947856315174, "B1.3": 0.07508690614136732}], "deliberation": {}, "interrupt": {"active": false, "reason": "No universal instability markers (airway compromise, severe respiratory compromise, uncontrolled haemorrhage) are present. Tachycardia and borderline hypotension suggest hypovo